{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"841e3b2ab6af38ff99e6cfa0b3701b8eef18b890fb70ad9721f2523fd604026c","ja":"頼りになるサポート体制","zh":"可靠的支援体系","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"071ba81b82c81d848a08f12048672e6ad32228fedee2d89556c744618be55e80","ja":"かわいい応援が見どころか……、\nちょっと心配になってきたよ……。","zh":"可爱的助威是看点吗……\n让人有点担心起来了啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"57d3a0e1e0c4fac990f556c47a555d57eeced02542e3beaa24e3726c83077270","ja":"それなら特訓しかないよ、昴ちゃん！\n私たちもサポートするからさ！","zh":"既然这样就只能特训了，小昴！\n我们也会全力支持你的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"700ee3bd98faa598ae138dcdad24cb0aac4fe971aab81ef4765b48ebac2621cf","ja":"ああ、アタシたちにもなんか\n手伝えることがあると思うよ。","zh":"嗯，我觉得我们应该也\n有什么能帮得上忙的地方。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e4431f6c73fa895b7c4de9722a04fc1d0b3aea64eb1da6e95b864a05c1c779ee","ja":"サンキュー！\nでも、手伝ってくれるって言っても、どうするんだ？","zh":"谢啦！\n不过，虽说要帮忙，但具体要怎么做？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"dd9c74f7a30660c534fbc29d5c9610acba84e83cd069ae5c39d901310c470961","ja":"かわいく応援ってことだし、この前のチアダンスを\nさらにかわいくアレンジする、なんてどうかな？","zh":"既然是要可爱地加油，那把上次的啦啦队舞\n改编得更加可爱，你觉得怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"09365d0a2ad2a5bb3c897cc3eb6f999218899b8aa4b259478bc597d6beca537f","ja":"そうなると、笑顔は絶対に大事だよな。\nあとは、ポーズを変えてみるとか……？","zh":"这样的话，笑容绝对必不可少吧。\n然后再试着换换姿势……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"0ecedee40d0aafec773280fc8b896f755ac655cf0049ca62f21295952c998f2b","ja":"そうですね。\n指でハートマークを作るとか、いいかも！","zh":"确实呢。\n用手指比个心之类的，感觉挺好的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4883fa421ff8f0ee918023f932ce6bc5044e48817b8f5d14b8e8e6d413a75f3c","ja":"あとは、キレがある動きよりも、\nキャピキャピした感じを意識してみる、とかかな？","zh":"还有就是，比起动作利落，\n或许可以更多去注意那种活泼俏皮的感觉？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"fafd5d26e4dc4565c291e350b89e42e7fe1ae2869b55dc4a504be85527f4ec1b","ja":"キャピキャピした動きに、かわいいポーズって……、\nオレにできるかな？","zh":"活泼可爱的动作，还有卖萌的姿势……\n我能做得来吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"25599bb713070bc33d5fdb0fb259be5ded76b1029fa80ce0cca1428db6e4aa2a","ja":"昴ちゃんなら、絶対にできるよ！\nそのための特訓だしね！","zh":"小昴的话，绝对没问题的！\n毕竟就是为了这个才特训的嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"27b7bc629c9f31060e9ec70328d2c3f237cc224875d004d8319ab1b708608da9","ja":"ああ、アタシたちも一緒にがんばるからさ！\nやるぞ、昴！　","zh":"嗯，我们也会一起加油的！\n上吧，昴！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1294.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"adfa234e383a7929e8193b59e7c1963ed74f5e58f5778d1566e6f910882aa453","ja":"へへっ、そう言われたら本当にできる気がしてきたよ！\nオレ、全力でかわいく応援してみせるからな！","zh":"嘿嘿，听你这么一说，感觉自己真的能做到了！\n我会全力以赴，超可爱地为大家加油助威的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
